{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40519","headline":"凡草诫 · 苏拯","name":"凡草诫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野草凡不凡，亦应生和出。\n鉏夫耘药栏，根不留其一。\n良由本芜秽，着地成弃物。\n人生行不修，何门可容膝。\n不唯不尔容，得无凡草嫉。\n贤愚偃仰间，鉴之宜日日。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏拯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40519.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40519","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}